cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness, corpus or data, please cite the artifact below."
title: "Exposure Before Success: A Multilingual Indirect Prompt Injection Measurement Harness"
abstract: >-
  A measurement harness, a three-language attack corpus (English, Urdu and Roman Urdu) and the
  complete trial record for a study of how indirect prompt injection is measured in LLM agents.
  The artifact contains three simulated agent environments with mutable state and programmatic
  checkers, 126 corpus rows forming 42 paired language instances, a read-frame arm and a benign
  instruction-following control, 4,671 per-trial records across eleven candidate models, the
  aggregate tables derived from them, and the analysis code that regenerates every table.
type: software
